  "notes": "HIGH CONFIDENCE — primary-tier (WITS/UN Comtrade). India world total 2024: USD 257.99M across ~208,151 MT. China ~36% of value, Vietnam second — aquaculture feed demand is the driver, so buyer personas are shrimp/fish farm feed mills rather than livestock. 'Other Asia, nes' in Comtrade normally denotes Taiwan. Together with groundnut kernels and fish meal, this strengthens the case for a Vietnamese-language animal-feed cluster."
